  "limits": [
    "Corrects Sea-shroom neck attachment across native animation cycles. All five Zombotany modes enforce plant-headed spawns and normalize old Continue data. Safe ordinary actors retain identity, health and position; unsupported legacy rigs are removed without loot or awards. Saved layouts are unchanged.",
    "All retained native cases run against the current production objects. Synthetic controls are separately labeled. Browser observations and timing measurements are recorded separately; native tests do not certify browser/compositor performance. Historical Torch observations remain historical."
